# Generated artifacts that embed the operator's REAL private Tachi memory
# content (query text, ids, summaries pulled straight from a live
# ~/.tachi/global/memory.db snapshot). Never commit these -- regenerate
# locally with export_snapshot.py / compare.py instead. See README.md.
# (FINDINGS-flush.json is NOT excluded: probe_flush.py only ever touches
# synthetic scratch collections, never real memory content.)
snapshot*.jsonl
reports/*.jsonl
reports/*.md
!reports/.gitkeep

__pycache__/
*.pyc
